<title>USA: May Department Stores Co Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>May Department Stores Co Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.37		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			 94,000		  109,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,586,000		2,402,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     252,300		  265,800</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q1 net income after $4.0 million or $0.01 a share extraordinary loss on early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Year-ago Q1 net income after $11.0 million or $0.05 a share income from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>Excluding items in both years, current Q1 earnings from continuing operations $98.0 million or $0.38 a share vs $98.0 million or $0.36 a share in year-ago Q1.</p>
<p>Revenues in table reflect net retail sales. Total revenues for current Q1 $2.68 billion vs $2.51 billion.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
